<http://data.silknow.org/object/a9623832-cb4b-329a-9b38-296ad6254174>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Quadrilateral panel.  Polychrome silks and crewels on linen canvas; design worked entirely in petit point.  Shows a tiny hill from which grow a variety of flowering plants including roses, tulips and carnations, on a white field; bordering this, a band of floral sprigs on a white ground.  Two lower corners not embroidered; covered with pieces of similar embroidery.  Originally probably rectangular; now pulled into a parallelogram.  Slightly faded."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/1f5c6379-18c6-397a-a9ba-04bbf110ce45> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Quadrilateral panel.  Polychrome silks and crewels on linen canvas; design worked entirely in petit point.  Shows a tiny hill from which grow a variety of flowering plants including roses, tulips and carnations, on a white field; bordering this, a band of floral sprigs on a white ground.  Two lower corners not embroidered; covered with pieces of similar embroidery.  Originally probably rectangular; now pulled into a parallelogram.  Slightly faded."@en ;
